WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
As I stand in the wind on a hill by a port town,

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
minatomachi oka no ue kaze wo uke

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
mezurashii kurai atama wa karappo

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
my head feels unusually empty.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
I was watching the town from the south side of the shore.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
haruka minami mukougishi de kono machi wo miteita

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
And so I sunk my unsteady passion into the depths of the sea.

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
guratsuita jounetsu wo umi ni shizumeta

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
This surging power...

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
tome donaku afureru chikara

00:29.073 --> 00:31.160
Black Jack

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
It's something hidden in everyone, everywhere.

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
sonnamono wa darenimo dokonimo hisonde iru mono

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
Day after day, everyone tries their best.

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
mainichi mainichi minna ganbaru

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
But people get annoyed when I mention it.

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
sore wo ieba hito wa mina kemutagaru

00:57.685 --> 00:59.376
Oh FREEDOM

00:59.376 --> 01:01.369
will be there

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
It makes me glad...

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
yokatta

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
That I found my place here.

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
ibasho ga koko ni attakara

01:12.127 --> 01:13.645
Oh WISDOM

01:13.645 --> 01:15.494
will be there

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
I searched for the reason

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
sagashita

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
why we can believe in the same air

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
onaji kuuki shinjirarerukoto

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
as long as we're alive.

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
ínochi aru kagiri

01:32.678 --> 01:34.763
He weaves the thread of life with his miraculous control of a scalpel.

01:34.847 --> 01:37.031
The genius surgeon who lives on a cape.

01:37.183 --> 01:39.794
His name is Black Jack.

02:54.963 --> 02:58.173
Originally "Face Sore” by Tezuka Osamu

02:54.963 --> 02:58.173
The Real Desire of the Face Sore

02:58.716 --> 03:01.051
Ohmigewdness!

03:04.399 --> 03:07.266
You're such a scaredy-cat.

03:07.600 --> 03:09.226
I'm a frail lady!

03:09.227 --> 03:13.063
You're awful for scaring me with such a grotesque story!

03:13.064 --> 03:14.314
What's the matter?

03:14.315 --> 03:15.607
What's the quarrel about?

03:15.608 --> 03:17.401
Sharaku made up some gross stories.

03:17.402 --> 03:20.362
Sharaku made up some gross stories.

03:20.363 --> 03:22.177
It's in the book.

03:22.358 --> 03:23.050
Which one?

03:23.074 --> 03:25.617
This is a magazine that collects nonfiction stories.

03:25.751 --> 03:27.536
I didn't make it up!

03:27.537 --> 03:31.087
Isn't a face sore just a boil somewhere on your body

03:31.291 --> 03:34.001
that looks like a person's face?

03:34.002 --> 03:38.130
N-No! I don't believe it!

03:38.386 --> 03:40.090
But we can't brush it off as fiction.

03:40.091 --> 03:42.968
He says they sometimes talk.

03:42.969 --> 03:43.969
No way...

03:43.970 --> 03:45.387
See?

03:45.513 --> 03:47.323
So, what's the story about?

03:47.557 --> 03:50.559
You actually like that kind of stuff?

03:51.144 --> 03:52.477
Let's see...

03:52.478 --> 03:56.089
This is a story of a man, A,
who lives in the Hokuriku region.

03:56.399 --> 04:00.442
Approximately twenty-five years ago,
when A was a junior high student,

04:00.820 --> 04:04.575
he killed a large toad near his house.

04:04.949 --> 04:09.077
The blood from the toad spurted onto his body.

04:09.078 --> 04:11.125
That didn't really bother him.

04:11.331 --> 04:15.959
Four or five days later, he contracted a high fever,

04:15.960 --> 04:19.296
and a large boil formed on his belly.

04:21.215 --> 04:23.008
So gross...

04:23.009 --> 04:24.781
Yeah, that's scary.

04:25.136 --> 04:26.219
Then what?

04:27.347 --> 04:30.432
His parents were very worried,
and had a doctor take a looks at it.

04:30.703 --> 04:33.602
The doctor diagnosed it as a face sore.

04:34.020 --> 04:38.296
Then, the boil opened its large mouth
to scare and spit mucus at the doctor.

04:38.733 --> 04:43.248
The doctor diluted tobacco tar with some grease,
and poured it into the boil.

04:45.406 --> 04:50.123
The boil disappeared from A's belly,
and he seemed to have recovered.

04:50.745 --> 04:55.499
But he was unable to stand for three or four years.

04:55.500 --> 04:57.752
He could only crawl around.

04:58.245 --> 05:02.589
The way he moved was just like a toad.

05:02.590 --> 05:04.800
Stop it! They're all lies!

05:05.103 --> 05:07.135
What happened to him after that?

05:07.136 --> 05:11.366
Apparently, he's all healthy and still alive.

05:11.599 --> 05:13.975
That's a mysterious story.

05:13.976 --> 05:18.772
There are thing's that can't be explained scientifically.

05:18.773 --> 05:22.526
Go ahead and have fun with your fake stories!

05:22.811 --> 05:23.944
I'm going home!

05:23.945 --> 05:27.364
Pinoco-chan! Wait—

05:57.520 --> 05:59.669
Hey! Be quiet, Largo!

06:09.615 --> 06:12.117
Please wait here for a minute.

06:12.118 --> 06:14.077
Doc will be out soon.

06:14.324 --> 06:16.496
Thank you, Miss.

06:18.291 --> 06:19.703
Doc!

06:20.877 --> 06:23.837
I-I-It's the invisible man!

06:24.464 --> 06:26.006
Invisible man?

06:29.677 --> 06:31.511
I am Black Jack.

06:31.512 --> 06:34.723
I called earlier about receiving treatment.

06:35.099 --> 06:37.311
Are you aware that I am unlicensed?

06:37.518 --> 06:39.243
I am.

06:39.562 --> 06:42.144
I want to be treated secretly for a reason.

06:42.607 --> 06:45.025
I get many patients like that,

06:45.322 --> 06:48.487
so my fees are higher compared to other doctors.

06:48.519 --> 06:49.519
That's fine.

06:49.864 --> 06:52.854
I will pay whatever you ask, as long as I get better.

06:56.245 --> 06:59.978
He seems like an eerie, bad man.

07:02.668 --> 07:05.086
Is Doc doing OK?

07:05.463 --> 07:08.144
Doctor, will I get better?

07:08.424 --> 07:10.098
Let me see it first.

07:10.343 --> 07:16.306
It came out without any warning one day,
and I've been like this ever since.

07:17.266 --> 07:22.270
I haven't been able to go out because of it,
and I can't even go to work.

07:33.658 --> 07:36.117
Oh! This is terrible.

07:36.118 --> 07:38.328
Is it a form of rash or chemical poisoning?

07:38.329 --> 07:40.046
Nothing like that.

07:40.248 --> 07:43.269
Have you heard of face sores?

07:43.501 --> 07:45.045
Face sores?

07:45.378 --> 07:47.147
There is no such medical condition.

07:47.880 --> 07:50.954
Fiction and TV shows use it though.

07:51.175 --> 07:54.803
To patients, an official name doesn't matter.

07:55.346 --> 07:58.557
To me, this is a face sore.

07:58.558 --> 08:00.517
F-Face sore?!

08:05.611 --> 08:07.357
That's my assistant.

08:07.358 --> 08:09.276
She's a bit of a scaredy-cat.

08:10.361 --> 08:11.861
We can't blame her.

08:11.862 --> 08:14.239
Anyone would be scared of my face.

08:14.240 --> 08:16.241
It even speaks on its own.

08:17.406 --> 08:21.788
It starts speaking against my will.

08:22.000 --> 08:23.789
What about what you're saying right now?

08:24.000 --> 08:25.805
These are my own words.

08:26.168 --> 08:28.181
Face sores talk, right?

08:29.589 --> 08:33.717
Doctor, please take this off of me.

08:33.911 --> 08:35.444
Please.

08:37.805 --> 08:40.015
This was my face before it changed.

08:44.103 --> 08:45.145
I see.

08:45.146 --> 08:46.728
It's a drastic deformation.

08:47.440 --> 08:48.898
Let me diagnose you first.

08:55.531 --> 08:58.116
These are either furuncles or carbuncles.

08:58.117 --> 08:59.987
They're pus-filled sores.

09:03.372 --> 09:04.789
Don't touch me.

09:04.790 --> 09:05.790
What?

09:09.086 --> 09:11.196
I said don't touch me!

09:11.464 --> 09:15.514
I'll make you pay for it if you try to get rid of me, Doctor.

09:15.760 --> 09:17.266
Who's talking?

09:17.470 --> 09:18.928
My patient? Or...

09:18.929 --> 09:20.513
Not this man.

09:20.514 --> 09:22.098
It's my other self.

09:22.475 --> 09:23.558
Your other self?

09:26.270 --> 09:28.855
I'm gonna possess him for life!

09:29.231 --> 09:31.943
There's no use in trying!

09:36.664 --> 09:41.010
Stay out of this if you want to live, you fake doctor!

09:44.297 --> 09:46.381
Let go of Doc!

10:01.564 --> 10:03.690
Doctor? Is something wrong?

10:04.275 --> 10:05.637
You don't remember?

10:07.111 --> 10:08.945
Did I do something?

10:10.114 --> 10:12.741
D-Did the face sore come out?

10:12.742 --> 10:13.659
Yeah.

10:14.160 --> 10:15.488
D-Doctor!

10:15.703 --> 10:16.995
I'm fine.

10:16.996 --> 10:18.372
Lay on the bed.

10:21.334 --> 10:22.542
Doctor...

10:22.543 --> 10:24.430
It'll be tight, but bear with me.

10:24.837 --> 10:28.548
I don't want the face sore to come
out and become violent again.

10:35.056 --> 10:38.016
What are you trying to do by binding me?

10:38.434 --> 10:39.643
There you are.

10:39.709 --> 10:40.709
Let me out!

10:40.770 --> 10:41.978
Let me out!

10:42.127 --> 10:43.438
You quack!

10:43.439 --> 10:45.263
Go ahead and treat me!

10:45.650 --> 10:49.243
If you do, I'll bite your throat and tear it off!

10:49.487 --> 10:51.655
Stay quiet for a while.

10:53.116 --> 10:54.096
Stop it!

10:54.283 --> 10:56.159
Don't operate on me!

10:56.160 --> 10:58.412
Stop it! Stop it!

10:58.413 --> 10:59.621
Stop it!

10:59.622 --> 11:00.447
Sto...

11:02.792 --> 11:04.584
Pinoco! Prepare an operation!

11:06.921 --> 11:07.983
Pinoco...

11:13.550 --> 11:16.290
Tezuka Clinic

11:14.303 --> 11:16.513
What? You need help with an operation?

11:16.514 --> 11:19.766
Yes. My assistant is not in any condition to help.

11:19.767 --> 11:20.684
Huh?

11:21.097 --> 11:23.550
The patient has dissociative identity disorder.

11:24.037 --> 11:24.757
What?

11:25.083 --> 11:26.216
He has multiple personalities?

11:26.383 --> 11:27.118
Yes.

11:28.025 --> 11:30.818
The epidermis and the subcutaneous
fat are unusually augmented.

11:31.237 --> 11:33.530
The lymph nodes are swollen too.

11:33.531 --> 11:37.576
Multiple personality disorder is a mental illness where
a person develops a completely new personality

11:37.577 --> 11:40.203
that acts just like it's always existed,

11:40.204 --> 11:46.626
and switches back and forth between the new and the old.

11:47.086 --> 11:51.089
But in the case of this patient,
the face sore happened first,

11:51.090 --> 11:53.091
and the personality changed after that.

11:54.093 --> 11:56.052
This is the first time that I've heard of such a case.

11:56.471 --> 11:58.762
The mental illness and the face sore...

11:59.056 --> 12:01.767
There must be something happening
inside this man's mind.

12:03.186 --> 12:06.053
Either way, our priority now is to restore this man's face. -

12:06.481 --> 12:07.939
Commencing the operation.

12:08.299 --> 12:08.912
Scalpel.

12:27.566 --> 12:28.566
Oh?

12:28.669 --> 12:30.373
I've seen this face somewhere.

12:30.797 --> 12:32.957
But where was it...

12:38.221 --> 12:44.100
Doc, is this the original face of that face sore guy?

12:44.101 --> 12:45.101
It is.

12:47.146 --> 12:50.065
I've seen this face somewhere before.

12:50.483 --> 12:52.436
Tezuka said the same thing.

12:52.699 --> 12:54.206
Where did you see it, Pinoco?

12:54.399 --> 12:58.386
I can't remember where it was.

12:59.486 --> 13:01.083
Where was it?

13:01.749 --> 13:04.169
I know I've seen it.

13:13.756 --> 13:17.551
Doctor, is my face really back to normal?

13:17.552 --> 13:19.040
Yes, don't worry.

13:19.303 --> 13:20.693
The operation was successful.

13:20.930 --> 13:23.265
I concur, as his assistant.

13:23.359 --> 13:24.845
Thank you.

13:25.393 --> 13:27.255
Now, let me take off the bandage.

13:27.478 --> 13:28.473
Please go.

13:29.522 --> 13:32.190
My face itches a bit.

13:33.359 --> 13:35.716
It's a sign that you're getting better.

13:38.698 --> 13:40.615
N-No way!

13:41.701 --> 13:42.602
What is it?

13:43.411 --> 13:44.953
Th-This is...

13:44.954 --> 13:46.813
Nothing has changed!

13:47.039 --> 13:48.748
What's going on?

13:48.749 --> 13:49.973
I can't believe this.

13:50.793 --> 13:53.712
I told you that it's no use working on me!

13:53.713 --> 13:55.422
Huh, cheat doctor!

13:55.840 --> 13:57.437
There's the second personality.

13:57.633 --> 14:02.128
Let me tell ya. I'll always survive, unless he dies.

14:03.890 --> 14:05.468
Anyway, I'm heading home.

14:07.685 --> 14:08.351
I won't let you!

14:08.477 --> 14:10.103
Don't do it, Black Jack!

14:10.104 --> 14:12.606
Don't rush it, just because the operation didn't work out!

14:12.607 --> 14:13.607
Let me go!

14:18.195 --> 14:18.987
Wait!

14:30.583 --> 14:31.575
Black Jack!

14:40.092 --> 14:41.343
It's OK.

14:41.344 --> 14:42.799
I didn't stab any critical spots.

14:43.721 --> 14:45.555
What did you just do?

14:46.140 --> 14:49.399
This man's illness has psychological origins.

14:49.769 --> 14:53.116
Putting him to sleep with anesthesia didn't fix that.

14:53.522 --> 14:58.526
It was a drastic remedy, but only this kind of shock
treatment can suppress the other personality.

15:00.071 --> 15:02.425
So you attacked him for a reason.

15:04.075 --> 15:05.665
You handle the stitching of the chest.

15:05.993 --> 15:08.119
I will redo the restoration of his face.

15:08.138 --> 15:08.691
Yeah.

15:09.664 --> 15:10.913
<i>Please work this time.</i>

15:11.290 --> 15:12.666
<i>Don't go back.</i>

15:16.584 --> 15:18.494
One Month Later

15:32.645 --> 15:33.895
Doctor...

15:33.896 --> 15:36.147
It should never come back again.

15:37.400 --> 15:38.860
Thank you,

15:41.654 --> 15:44.990
Miss, I'm sorry that I scared you.

15:53.916 --> 15:56.418
I know I've seen him somewhere,

15:56.877 --> 15:58.831
but I can't remember.

15:59.588 --> 16:01.840
You can mail me the fee later.

16:01.841 --> 16:02.632
No.

16:02.633 --> 16:08.096
Since it's a large amount of money,
would you come to my place once it's ready?

16:09.140 --> 16:11.558
I will call you another day, then.

16:17.246 --> 16:19.706
Where was it...

16:22.710 --> 16:24.297
I know that place.

16:25.254 --> 16:26.413
Then I'll come now.

16:26.672 --> 16:27.754
Thank you.

16:29.175 --> 16:30.175
Doc,

16:30.843 --> 16:34.012
please don't go to that man's place.

16:34.972 --> 16:36.473
It's my hunch,

16:36.474 --> 16:40.147
I have a feeling that something bad may happen.

16:40.561 --> 16:41.937
Don't worry.

16:41.938 --> 16:43.647
The operation was successful.

16:43.648 --> 16:47.597
No matter what kind of secrets that man might have,
he needs to pay for the treatment.

16:47.819 --> 16:49.486
But Doc...

16:49.487 --> 16:50.403
I'm off.

16:57.889 --> 16:58.771
Sneak...

17:05.628 --> 17:09.089
<i>You'll see what happens when you
ignore a woman's intuition.</i>

17:09.090 --> 17:09.840
<i>Ouch!</i>

17:09.841 --> 17:11.007
<i>Ow! Ow! Ow!</i>

17:30.956 --> 17:33.010
How has your face been?

17:33.364 --> 17:37.159
The face sore hasn't come out since then.

17:37.160 --> 17:38.243
I see.

17:38.244 --> 17:40.954
That illness is psychological.

17:40.955 --> 17:44.249
Are you hiding troubles inside yourself?

17:45.543 --> 17:46.918
Trouble...

17:47.837 --> 17:53.633
It's a very private matter,
so it's something I'd rather not tell anyone.

17:54.182 --> 17:55.070
I see.

17:55.094 --> 17:58.722
Then I'll leave as soon as I receive the treatment fee.

18:01.017 --> 18:02.684
Now I remember!

18:02.685 --> 18:05.061
| saw that face at Tom's!

18:05.605 --> 18:07.772
Stop! That's enough!

18:10.805 --> 18:12.538
Serial Killer
on the Loose

18:13.765 --> 18:15.390
Ohmigewdness!

18:16.601 --> 18:19.478
Pinoco! What are you doing here?

18:19.586 --> 18:23.148
Doc! He's a murderer!

18:23.149 --> 18:23.837
What?

18:25.401 --> 18:26.541
Doc!

18:29.072 --> 18:31.152
Doc!

18:31.746 --> 18:34.451
Pinoco! Run away!

18:48.633 --> 18:51.260
It's a dead end!

18:56.432 --> 18:58.976
You can't run anymore, Miss.

19:00.561 --> 19:02.229
Are you going to kill me?

19:02.230 --> 19:04.439
Kill a fair maiden?

19:04.857 --> 19:09.236
I don't have a choice, since you found out who I am.

19:09.737 --> 19:10.988
Take a look at that mountain over there.

19:11.656 --> 19:16.285
That mountain hides at least five people
that I've killed and buried.

19:19.289 --> 19:21.256
You're a hitman?

19:22.750 --> 19:23.792
Damn!

19:23.793 --> 19:24.334
Wait!

19:25.795 --> 19:26.628
Freeze!

19:27.588 --> 19:31.717
I'll drop her off the cliff if you come any closer.

19:32.093 --> 19:33.135
Don't do it!

19:34.554 --> 19:37.264
I'm truly grateful to you, Doctor.

19:37.473 --> 19:43.228
When that face sore appeared,
I lost my desire to be a hitman.

19:43.604 --> 19:50.015
But now that my face has been restored,
the desire is returning.

19:52.939 --> 19:54.281
You're ill!

19:54.282 --> 19:55.115
Let go of Pinoco!

19:55.116 --> 19:58.015
Yeah, I'll throw her off the cliff.

20:03.166 --> 20:04.541
Doc!

20:06.502 --> 20:08.962
M-My face is burning!

20:08.963 --> 20:10.945
Burning hot!

20:12.175 --> 20:13.759
Ouch!

20:15.845 --> 20:17.994
The face sore has reappeared.

20:20.099 --> 20:22.309
D-Doctor!

20:22.310 --> 20:25.729
I wasn't cured yet!

20:48.961 --> 20:51.755
Hey Doctor, we meet again...

20:52.173 --> 20:54.137
You are the other self?

20:54.509 --> 20:56.093
I am.

20:56.094 --> 21:00.025
Doctor, I told you not to touch me.

21:00.390 --> 21:04.017
As long as I was out, he stayed quiet.

21:04.352 --> 21:07.979
I wanted to stay in this face for the rest of my life.

21:08.141 --> 21:09.364
I see...

21:09.899 --> 21:13.151
The face sore was this man's conscience,

21:13.152 --> 21:17.823
Doctor, let this man die now.

21:29.836 --> 21:34.131
<i>Death does not bring atonement
for the sins he has committed.</i>

21:34.737 --> 21:35.826
Doc!

21:37.468 --> 21:39.426
I will save this man's life.

21:40.623 --> 21:44.773
One Year Later

21:41.881 --> 21:47.364
The crimes committed by the defendant
are of extreme cruelty.

21:47.664 --> 21:50.800
We demand that he be sentenced to life in prison.

21:51.365 --> 21:53.772
Defendant, admit guilt to all charges?

21:54.318 --> 21:57.705
Yes, I will accept any punishment.

22:10.555 --> 22:17.561
I want to capture your heart with my silly smile.

22:10.555 --> 22:17.561
itazura no hohemi de muchuu ni sasetaino

22:17.562 --> 22:24.734
Only look straight at me.

22:17.562 --> 22:24.734
massugu na kimi no me ni watashi wo utsushitene

22:24.779 --> 22:32.036
Being kind isn't good enough.

22:24.779 --> 22:32.036
yasashii dake dewa nanika tarinaino

22:32.037 --> 22:42.546
I want to get in touch with your true heart, deep
within the you that nobody else sees.

22:32.037 --> 22:42.546
dare nimo misenai kokoro no oku no sotto furetai

22:42.547 --> 22:47.927
Being in the gentle sunlight,

22:42.547 --> 22:47.927
yawaraka na hizashi abite

22:47.928 --> 22:57.311
I wish on the clover that plays the melody of dreams,

22:47.928 --> 22:53.133
yume wo kanaderu clover

22:53.588 --> 22:57.312
kaze ni negai wo nosete

22:57.312 --> 23:08.072
and I search for a ray of hope beyond the blue skies,

22:57.312 --> 23:08.072
aoi sora no mukou e kibou no hikari sagasuno

23:08.073 --> 23:13.160
because I want to stay by your side forever.

23:08.073 --> 23:13.160
zutto soba ni itakara

23:13.161 --> 23:26.131
The promise we made long ago in a far away place...

23:13.161 --> 23:26.131
haruka kanata de zutto mae kara

23:26.132 --> 23:33.055
is finally coming to a realization, overcoming the incredible distance,

23:26.132 --> 23:33.055
hikari ni terasare michibikareru youni

23:33.056 --> 23:43.941
just as it was lead by the light.

23:33.056 --> 23:36.989
sora no hate tooku

23:37.082 --> 23:43.882
toki wo koete ima tadori tsuku

23:45.061 --> 24:15.076
Separated Brothers

23:45.674 --> 23:47.747
My older brother has cancer.

23:48.014 --> 23:49.694
I will become a doctor.

23:49.820 --> 23:51.380
I will too.

23:51.440 --> 23:52.467
Dad!

23:53.080 --> 23:55.273
Did you bring a doctor who can cure me?

23:55.407 --> 23:57.114
I made my son become a doctor.

23:57.211 --> 23:57.798
What?

23:57.925 --> 24:00.458
This is the president's way of atonement.

24:00.898 --> 24:05.003
Even in an instant, you can find breathtaking glory.

24:05.392 --> 24:06.525
So, there's a reason behind this...

24:08.142 --> 24:11.009
But I can't guarantee how
well it will work.

24:11.616 --> 24:14.469
Next Karte - Separated Brothers.

24:16.120 --> 24:17.870
Karte NG...

24:21.292 --> 24:23.418
Ouch.

24:23.444 --> 24:24.444
Why...
